e. A recount needs a court order."], "changed": {"since": "7 PM", "head": "Colom's chance held at >99%; most likely final margin Colom +9,900 to Colom +10,100.", "items": ["About 172 new votes were counted. The lead in counted votes went from Colom +2,678 to Colom +2,652. Most came from Prentiss (172 votes, Hyde-Smith +26).", "AP changed its estimate of ballots left to count in 1 county (28,250 to 28,150 statewide). Biggest effects: Prentiss, 100 fewer (Hyde-Smith +47 pts there). Together these shift the expected outcome about 50 votes toward Colom."]}, "votelog": {"since": "2026-11-04T09:29:13.386580-06:00", "rows": [{"t": "2026-11-10T19:30:07.427890-06:00", "new": 178, "batch": -26, "lead": 2652, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Prentiss", "v": 178, "m": -26}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T19:00:07.226454-06:00", "new": 3, "batch": -1, "lead": 2678, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Choctaw", "v": 3, "m": -1}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T18:30:07.197351-06:00", "new": 52, "batch": 46, "lead": 2679, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Tunica", "v": 52, "m": 46}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T16:30:07.183201-06:00", "new": 157, "batch": 29, "lead": 2633, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Attala", "v": 157, "m": 29}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T16:00:08.224488-06:00", "new": 27, "batch": -3, "lead": 2604, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Carroll", "v": 27, "m": -3}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T14:30:07.164189-06:00", "new": 48, "batch": 32, "lead": 2607, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Humphreys", "v": 48, "m": 32}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T12:00:07.223660-06:00", "new": 80, "batch": 40, "lead": 2575, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Jefferson Davis", "v": 80, "m": 40}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T11:30:07.297221-06:00", "new": 1, "batch": -1, "lead": 2535, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Tishomingo", "v": 1, "m": -1}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-09T15:00:07.241527-06:00", "new": 104, "batch": -38, "lead": 2536, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Georg